(v_topic_id, 'altruism', '/ˈæltruɪzəm/', '(n) lòng vị tha, tính nhân hậu', 'Evolutionary thinkers argue that acts of genuine altruism and cooperation were essential for group survival.', 'Test 4', 3, 87, NOW() + interval '9687 seconds'),
(v_topic_id, 'primate', '/ˈpraɪmeɪt/', '(n) linh trưởng (người, khỉ, vượn)', 'The primate plays an essential role in the overall system.', 'Test 4', 3, 88, NOW() + interval '9688 seconds'),
(v_topic_id, 'hierarchical', '/ˌhaɪəˈrɑːkɪkl/', '(adj) có thứ bậc, phân cấp', 'The study revealed a hierarchical aspect of modern development.', 'Test 4', 3, 89, NOW() + interval '9689 seconds'),
(v_topic_id, 'advent', '/ˈædvent/', '(n) sự xuất hiện, sự đến', 'The transition from foraging to sedentary farming was marked by the sudden advent of private property concepts.', 'Test 4', 3, 90, NOW() + interval '9690 seconds'),
(v_topic_id, 'patriarchy', '/ˈpeɪtriɑːki/', '(n) chế độ phụ quyền / gia trưởng', 'The patriarchy plays an essential role in the overall system.', 'Test 4', 3, 91, NOW() + interval '9691 seconds'),
(v_topic_id, 'feasible', '/ˈfiːzəbl/', '(adj) khả thi, có lý', 'Modern evidence makes it less feasible to explain widespread warfare strictly as an inherited evolutionary trait.', 'Test 4', 3, 92, NOW() + interval '9692 seconds'),
