(v_topic_id, 'claim', '/kleɪm/', '(v/n) sự tán thưởng / sự khẳng định', 'Researchers need to claim the key factors involved in this process.', 'Test 4', 3, 98, NOW() + interval '9698 seconds'),
(v_topic_id, 'disruption', '/dɪsˈrʌpʃn/', '(n) sự xáo trộn, đứt gãy', 'There was great disruption in the classroom when the teacher left.', 'Test 4', 3, 99, NOW() + interval '9699 seconds'),
